{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:21:00+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "POG 5", "steam_appid": 1699450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POG 5</strong> is a cute, minimalist <strong>physics puzzle game</strong> where your goal is to guide a star block onto its matching star platform and keep it there for <strong>3 seconds</strong> to complete each level. Solve <strong>50 physics-based puzzles</strong> using logic, balance, and careful planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a charming <strong>2D puzzle game</strong> featuring clean geometric shapes, minimalist artwork, and relaxing background music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Position the Star. Master the Balance.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve engaging <strong>physics-based puzzles</strong> by carefully working out how to move the star block onto its designated platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study each level, observe the arrangement of objects, and plan your actions to position the star block correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the platform is only part of the challenge. Keep the block in place for <strong>3 seconds</strong> to successfully complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple mechanics are easy to understand, while different puzzle layouts challenge your observation, concentration, and logical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793927299\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793927299\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s