e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793927299\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793927299\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793927299\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793927299\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793927299\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793927299\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793927299\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.apng?t=1793927299\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699450/extras/45bd19e01eaae62cbab05533de195ba2.poster.avif?t=1793927299\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute and Minimalist Physics Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a charming world of <strong>minimalist 2D graphics</strong>, clean geometric shapes, and carefully arranged puzzle elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The uncluttered visuals keep your attention on solving each physics challenge, while calming background music creates a relaxing atmosphere for thoughtful gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy casual brain teasers or challenging <strong>physics puzzle games</strong>, POG 5 offers a satisfying combination of logic, balance, and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >50 Levels of Logic and Balance Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>50 levels</strong> featuring different arrangements of blocks, platforms, and physics-based puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the environment, think ahead, and discover how to position the star block correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your actions, find the right solution, and enjoy the satisfaction of keeping the star block securely on its platform.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 levels</strong> – Complete a collection of minimalist physics puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based gameplay</strong> – Solve challenges involving object positioning and balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star block puzzles</strong> – Guide the star block onto its matching platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-second balance challenges</strong> – Keep the star block in place for 3 seconds to complete each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic and precision</strong> – Observe each arrangement and carefully plan your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist 2D visuals</strong> – Enjoy clean geometric shapes and uncluttered puzzle artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute puzzle design</strong> – Discover charming levels built around simple physical interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple mouse controls</strong> – Enjoy intuitive mouse-based puzzle gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing music</strong> – Solve puzzles accompanied by a calm soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Steam Achievements</strong> – Unlock achievements as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Cloud support</strong> – Synchronize supported game progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player gameplay</strong> – Solve the physics challenges on your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Position the star block, master the balance, and complete all 50 levels of POG 5!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POG 5</strong> is a cute, minimalist <strong>physics puzzle game</strong> where your goal is to guide a star block onto its matching star platform and keep it there for <strong>3 seconds</strong> to complete each level. Solve <strong>50 physics-based puzzles</strong> using logic, balance, and careful planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a charming <strong>2D puzzle game</strong> featuring clean geometric shapes, minimalist artwork, and relaxing background music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Position the Star. Master the Balance.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve engaging <strong>physics-based puzzles</strong> by carefully working out how to move the star block onto its designated platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study each level, observe the arrangement of objects, and plan your actions to position the star block correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the platform is only part of the challenge. Keep the block in place for <strong>3 seconds</strong> to successfully complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple mechanics are easy to understand, while different puzzle layouts challenge your observation, concentration, and logical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/