ter.avif?t=1793927299\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=21 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute and Minimalist Physics Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a charming world of <strong>minimalist 2D graphics</strong>, clean geometric shapes, and carefully arranged puzzle elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The uncluttered visuals keep your attention on solving each physics challenge, while calming background music creates a relaxing atmosphere for thoughtful gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy casual brain teasers or challenging <strong>physics puzzle games</strong>, POG 5 offers a satisfying combination of logic, balance, and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >50 Levels of Logic and Balance Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>50 levels</strong> featuring different arrangements of blocks, platforms, and physics-based puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the environment, think ahead, and discover how to position the star block correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your actions, find the right solution, and enjoy the satisfaction of keeping the star block securely on its platform.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 levels</strong> – Complete a collection of minimalist physics puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based gameplay</strong> – Solve challenges involving object positioning and balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star block puzzles</strong> – Guide the star block onto its matching platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-second balance challenges</strong> – Keep the star block in place for 3 seconds to complete each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic and precision</strong> – Observe each arrangement and carefully plan your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist 2D visuals</strong> – Enjoy clean geometric shapes and uncluttered puzzle artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute puzzle design</strong> – Discover charming levels built around simple physical interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple mouse controls</strong> – Enjoy intuitive mouse-based puzzle gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing music</strong> – Solve puzzles accompanied by a calm soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Steam Achievements</strong> – Unlock achievements as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Cloud support</strong> – Synchronize supported game progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player gameplay</strong> – Solve the physics challenges on your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Position the star block, master the balance, and complete all 50 levels of POG 5!</strong></p>", "short_description": "POG 5 is a cute minimalist physics puzzle game. Guide the star block onto its matching platform and keep it there for 3 seconds to complete each level. Solve 50 physics-based challenges using logic, balance, and precise planning. Enjoy clean 2D visuals, relaxing music, and simple mouse controls.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Turkis